  "query_preview": "..\n(Sunday Night through next Friday) \nIssued at 1110 AM CDT Fri Oct 30 2026\n\nRain will taper off Sunday evening with dry and mild weather \nreturning for Monday and most of Tuesday. \n\nAnother low pressure system will approach by midweek. This one\nwill be larger, stronger, and slower moving, so rainfall totals\nare expected to be greater. Thankfully instability is unimpressive,\nso we are not worried about severe storms. Most of the midweek \nrain is expected to fall on Wednesday with a soaking rainfall \nevent expected. NBM shows a 60-70% chance for at least an inch, \nand a 25-35% chance of some locations picking up closer to two \ninches.\n\nDry and mild weather is expected by Friday, lasting through next \nweekend.",
